{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_04_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:48dbd521fece83d18c444d6f206fadfc7867c7058b8c48869107b7790d6ab22b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a88c1155e6944d94147dbba041a7da479e4aa0b3e5c1f53a218b534d53accf9",
      "text": "喂——大家——。《大扫除解决队》的板块，\n马上就要开始了哦——",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce1db13a5e0741b719af4b83bd092c7a67171be8dd3683cefbc3f08387b39b1e",
      "text": "Legenders的3个人，不知道紧不紧张啊～\n话说回来，怎么感觉我也紧张起来了……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0da54e3082b4f4ebf41ca147381031967e31b76a731eb27c7bb8cc43e1ea5d5f",
      "text": "不是，又不是悠介你要出场！\n不过嘛，能合格真的太好了呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e59487250feeba1fe820b8a868b09f2d2b1556f879494f284201dcfc4d64a336",
      "text": "雨彦先生很期待今天的出演呢。\n说是要在电视上展示前保洁员的手艺。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a68e55c45b4fcb984c800d4ad1419398b8920fe9f4e814ba50e5b6945ac8c9be",
      "text": "啊——，搞得我也想上电视了！\n下次跟监督……哎呀，光顾着说话时间到了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6be35a096d4c95b34da6f98bd3b4d447e4ba80e3ac9c44e936e40c6fca606f7",
      "text": "克里斯先生，表情好僵硬……在紧张吗？\n和平时一样就没问题了哦～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c6cde0c0eade3441d80b0874251654c770998cd91dc75f94cb177b3b8de66dd",
      "text": "啊啊。前阵子不是说过了吗？\n只要别忘了展现出我们的本色就好，对吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd468f5d8103f488c894f13f674087e89a7b7b31af9bed8bc2c6c414fb76d8a4",
      "text": "你们两位……也是呢。\n重要的是，不要忘记展现出自己的风格。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:049b84cc0d44ee13f39d28e59ca31cb93cb6da128cc46cdb1699dad6b8313268",
      "text": "是这样对吧，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96b8ffa222b890d916b64c1b0c103e9bcdab128eda497d7aa6175670dfa9c24b",
      "text": "嗯！只要保持自然的状态，就完全没问题。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e69628da36334a2d62a28e88b350553bfd852ad227f1541a90c71b25f87f78b",
      "text": "各位只要保持最本真的姿态，就有着最棒的魅力！\n……好，请出发吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d24ef33e3ef742103a07a86170db37c136bf1b0ee72fa805c53a8d00cfece5a9",
      "text": "好～的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  }
}
